OVERVIEW: Manage AI model registry

Manage the AI model registry for versioning and tracking models.

Examples:
  dicom-ai registry add --name pneumonia-v1 --path model.mlmodel --type
classification
  dicom-ai registry list
  dicom-ai registry remove --name pneumonia-v1
  dicom-ai registry search --tags chest,xray

USAGE: dicom-ai registry <subcommand>

OPTIONS:
  --version               Show the version.
  -h, --help              Show help information.

SUBCOMMANDS:
  add                     Add a model to the registry
  list                    List all models in the registry
  remove                  Remove a model from the registry
  search                  Search models by tags
  info                    Get detailed information about a model
  clear                   Clear all models from the registry

  See 'dicom-ai help registry <subcommand>' for detailed help.
